1
00:00:00,455 --> 00:00:02,615
M: Why didn't you take care of the electricity bill?

2
00:00:03,175 --> 00:00:06,555
I gave you my share of the bill and told you to pay it last Wednesday.

3
00:00:07,635 --> 00:00:10,005
We just got a second notice in the mail today.

4
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,335
W: You are kidding me.

5
00:00:11,875 --> 00:00:18,820
I was busy on the day you asked me because I had to run an important errand for my boss, so I just couldn't get to the bank on time.

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:23,835
And then I completely forgot all about it on Thursday because of the seminar I had to attend.

7
00:00:24,765 --> 00:00:29,115
I only remembered it after lunch on Friday and went straight to the bank and paid it.

8
00:00:29,735 --> 00:00:32,885
M: I guess they must have sent out the notice before you paid then.

9
00:00:33,595 --> 00:00:35,055
I'll call them and straighten this out.

10
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,345
W: I am sorry, but I couldn't help it.

11
00:00:37,775 --> 00:00:40,415
I'll remember to take care of the bills early from now on.
